      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Underlined route to supporting detail.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-link\" href=\"#research\">Explore all research <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a>",
